{
  "analysis": "The heredoc is still having issues with newline characters in strings. I need to use a different approach - I'll write the script using base64 encoding to avoid any shell interpretation issues.",
  "plan": "Encode the Python script as base64 and decode it to a file, then run it.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo '' | base64 -d > process_context.py\n",
      "duration": 0.5
